{"title":"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/e/5eee8fd0f8dc0946c64fbd05bc502c121977216c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$( \\sqrt{\\pi} , a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/8/6082ce983c636facfaaba5ed379d9ea1ff7d177d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$( \\sqrt{\\pi} , b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"19\" /> are distinct points on the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/d/1ddbf7cfd621ddd5178601a22f0b50cfa1e96378.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 + x^4 = 2x^2 y + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/1/3311eba472bf7dc846f58d649d3756cf443eb108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a-b|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/2/40282d4ee1afb46bf486005c78fce871c0286803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)} \\ \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)} \\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)} \\ \\sqrt{1+\\pi} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)} \\ 1 + \\sqrt{\\pi}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"452\" height=\"33\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since points on the graph make the equation true, substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee0529202bae221e2a886dbd92ecd50e87f90452.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\pi}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> in to the equation and then solve to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/2/d7252917d7c01b01feb99640c4f01aceb8d6a2b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 + \\sqrt{\\pi}^4 = 2\\sqrt{\\pi}^2 y + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"179\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/f/29f374ffef4a74ae8cf85aeed2441b77e213743f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 + \\pi^2 = 2\\pi y + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52ee88d873beea5c6a77f6293558d4c39a76d874.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 - 2\\pi y + \\pi^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/a/27ab241bf2d48f480b4c0fbd3d0703a863e8d9d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y-\\pi)^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/b/c3b2ed610c3c6faf80944d6bba5e39ddd99d0c77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y-\\pi = \\pm 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/a/f9ac25d77cfd0e2e79a183c0e6921c714dd841ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\pi + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/8/6f8e1fa63ea4132688df6a57ff770b2b6d23a33a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\pi - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>There are only two solutions to the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/a/27ab241bf2d48f480b4c0fbd3d0703a863e8d9d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y-\\pi)^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" />, so one of them is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and the other is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. The order does not matter because of the absolute value sign.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a4a1f64be6488051bd03a999055405eaa11a1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$| (\\pi + 1) - (\\pi - 1) | = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"178\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f530eb4e1a2b7f21a225ce5427c1f2707014f560.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This solution is very closely related to Solution #1 and just simplifies the problem earlier to make it easier.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/d/1ddbf7cfd621ddd5178601a22f0b50cfa1e96378.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 + x^4 = 2x^2 y + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" /> can be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/6/d1685db7d112651870310087b06477ae4b8e990b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4-2x^2y+y^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" />. Recognizing that this is a binomial square, simplify this to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44b3d6e5d9d1f17ce9162c416379525178d1de79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2-y)^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"19\" />. This gives us two equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85dc8827e2cac964004c1a64f3e14aa5cd8c69e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca6d390047e3a0533b05a7a2194559b536ebc76f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-y=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>One of these <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />'s is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and one is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee0529202bae221e2a886dbd92ecd50e87f90452.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\pi}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/a/76a008f0f83d4812bcbedd0248181bd2d970c89c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\pi+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/c/03ce89f3107c9e5d3f2c31be4ce20548a84bda2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\pi-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/8/098b5a6d7b8d721a470adbc5ff0232438097a658.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a-b|=|(\\pi+1)-(\\pi-1)|=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"252\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f530eb4e1a2b7f21a225ce5427c1f2707014f560.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This solution is similar to Solution #1 but uses a different way to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> at the end.\n</p><p>Just like Solution #1, we arrive at the conclusion that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52ee88d873beea5c6a77f6293558d4c39a76d874.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 - 2\\pi y + \\pi^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Simplifying we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/b/70ba497d1b41cd09201128e5aba369b593599a80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 - 2\\pi y + \\pi^2 -1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"176\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We now can factor this quadratic. We must find two terms that multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/552f255d89badf543639ccc7b51cca0fad0a0d89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi^2 -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> and add to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/9/709acef3551b886e6754de72d59a88f00660f0d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>These terms are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/4/a94470a0cacc75a853c89b3cfe8a7b7867d1a852.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/e/7fee4d2af7659f8e3fca20b1014e696bfbe1f1ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. \n</p><p>Subtracting one from the other, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f530eb4e1a2b7f21a225ce5427c1f2707014f560.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>-DuckDuckGooseGoose\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gKzliDi3zgk\">https://youtu.be/gKzliDi3zgk</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A\">2015 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017094636\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 319/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2324/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7977/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.854      1 -total\n 61.44%    7.897      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 37.56%    4.828      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13935:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017094636 and revision id 176525. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}